  "description": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_73010000000000001/attachments/24286017/dp_app.css\"><p><span><strong><u>OUT-OF-CLASS SESSIONS</u></strong>:</span>&nbsp;Y<span>ou may attend up to three out-of-class sessions to fulfill the 10 session requirement for the semester <strong>(you must attend at least seven in-class sessions to receive extra credit)</strong>. You can choose any events from the list provided on the out-of-class session page linked on this course's Canvas main page. After attending each event you will answer four questions. Each answer that you provide should be a summary of your experience.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Your answer to questions 4 through 7 must be a minimum of four sentences, and well thought out.</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span>All summaries for out-of-class sessions must be submitted&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #ff0000;\"><strong>NO LATER THAN ONE WEEK AFTER ATTENDING THE EVENT</strong></span>.</span></p><script src=\"https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_73010000000000001/attachments/24286016/dp_app.js\"></script>",
